/A 563 0 R
/Alt (The bar graph shows centre of pressure ellipse area differences between the participants after completing the static balance test. Diabetes determined a lower postural balance when standing with eyes closed on an unstable-foam surface, while diabetic neuropathy compromised postural balance on stable surfaces with closed eyes and in unstable surfaces in all vision conditions.)
